he raw error; finalizeToolCall applies explicit false/empty patches and preserves usage; a durable batch with one safe/safe and one unsafe effect_pending call replays only the safe call with its persisted args/memos (checkpoint dropped first) and interrupts the unsafe call with checkpoint details and usage intact, advancing to checkpoint; a parallel batch cancelled after the first admission does not replay the second safe call; a tool running when the gate closes fails the procedure with the terminal fault rather than the pending cancellation. Determinism: no real time, randomness or network as evidence; asynchronous ordering is controlled with promises (deferred resolvers, no timers). Each production file was individually restored to its faulty baseline and the script failed with a real node:assert/strict assertion (exit 1, no crash/import error/timeout): 'the safe/safe replay reruns exactly once with the persisted arguments and memos', 'the hook clears isError on the durable transcript', 'closing an aborting gate still signals admitted work'; the repaired tree passes in about 0.1s. Limitation: the repository's vitest suites under packages/agent/test were not run because no node_modules are installed in this workspace and dependency installation is out of scope; no other validation dependency was needed."
